    "full_width_text_zCyyyc": {
      "type": "full-width-text",
      "name": "Full Width Text",
      "settings": {
        "headline": "",
        "large_headline": "",
        "copy": "<p>As a double-board certified plastic and general surgeon, Dr. Christie uses plastic surgery as a strategic and highly individualized tool for aesthetic transformation. Informed by international clinical experience and a global perspective on beauty and aging, she prioritizes harmony, refinement, and the preservation of each patient’s natural identity.<br/><br/>Dr. Christie’s expertise spans a range of procedures, including breast augmentation and reconstruction, facial and body lifting, contouring, revision, and reparative surgery. Her practice also includes minimally invasive, in-office solutions that support prevention, longevity, and graceful maintenance.  <br/><br/>Surgical protocols are enhanced by the advanced therapeutics in regenerative and precision medicine, allowing for optimized results, faster recovery, and long-term skin and tissue support. Every procedure is thoughtfully integrated into a larger continuum of care, designed with your health, lifestyle and personal goals in mind, delivering exceptional outcomes with safety, subtlety, and intention.</p>"
      }
    },
    "full_width_text_k8MqxR": {
      "type": "full-width-text",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Full Width Text",
      "settings": {
